"refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "54117801", "author": {"steamid": "76561198057323098", "personaname": "Kha", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/42066642041/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 33, "playtime_forever": 37881, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 17821, "last_played": 1762528492, "avatar": "18591a583f0e931e7fb0482ceae13bdfec4758bc"}, "language": "english", "review": "Needs more rain ingame. [spoiler] (THEY ADDED RAIN... ON THE MOON!!) [/spoiler]\n\nPremise and structure-\nThis game is currently set on an Alien planet with many different environments, where you land solo or with your gang. You can follow a straight path to the end, or explore the whole stage, eventually working to charge the teleporter in order to move to the next stage, and so on. \n\nThe general idea of \"start to end\" of each level is to explore the level, take whatever pickups you can, drones, items, equipment, etc, while fighting through spawning enemies. Managing time is also a thing as enemies scale with it.\n\nWhat makes things interesting is how fast the whole pace of the run goes from 0 to 15. Especially if you're playing on monsoon. \nThere'll be enemies coming at you from every corner of the spatial dimension that you are in!!\n\nThe music is top notch, it fits really well with the zones and the game overall. \n\n\nCons-\n\n- Multiplayer which is good as it is, but needs some improvements in the UI and connection process.\n- Sometimes jumping or jump inducing skills can make you fly out of the map (mostly you get relocated to the ground but not always, and you can take big dmg or die).\n- Some graphical optimizations\n-Ability to ditch game midway without consequences needs to be disincentivized somehow.\n-Some players can be thieves (without mods). They will steal and hoard items. And they often die, taking most of the team's power with them. Eventually ragequitting..", "timestamp_created": 1563222609, "timestamp_updated": 1638109241, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "54116870", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056243979", "personaname": "ColeMooMoo", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198056243979/", "num_games_owned": 581, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 23690, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1116, "last_played": 1764224004, "avatar": "f6f2ce9a0ab764911ad19d57da52d9d6ad6210bf"}, "language": "english", "review": "Play it.", "timestamp_created": 1563219217, "timestamp_updated": 1647975908, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.509803950786590576", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1553788800", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "54116295", "author": {"steamid": "76561198040859866", "personaname": "Chain-Link Fence", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198040859866/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 2, "playtime_forever": 11165, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6511, "last_played": 1682735299, "avatar": "79d58721eb232b1835f6e1de67ec70426f3a361a"}, "language": "english", "review": "i am like gaem", "timestamp_created": 1563216909, "timestamp_updated": 1563216909, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 2, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503816783428192139", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": fals